@startuml
!include business_symbols.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #315E57
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A9892
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #173F39
skinparam ActorBorderColor #315E57
skinparam ActorFontColor #173F39
skinparam EntityBorderColor #315E57
skinparam EntityFontColor #173F39
hide footbox

participant "<$business_worker>\n门店员工" as Clerk
participant "<$business_entity>\n租赁与维护管理系统" as System
participant "<$business_actor>\n维修承包商" as Repairer

Clerk -> System : 提交维修工单(装备、故障、承包商)
activate System
System -> System : 校验装备未出租并生成唯一工单()
System -> System : 将装备标记为维修中并暂停出租()
System --> Repairer : 分派维修工单(工单号、故障描述)
activate Repairer
Repairer --> System : 接单并提交预计完成时间
System --> Clerk : 返回工单编号、装备状态与预计时间
deactivate System

Repairer -> System : 更新维修进度(工单号、阶段、说明)
activate System
System -> System : 追加进度记录并更新门店待办()
System --> Clerk : 返回最新维修进度
deactivate System
Repairer -> System : 提交维修完成结果(工单号、维修说明)
activate System
System -> System : 将工单转为待安全检查()
System --> Clerk : 生成安全检查待办
deactivate System
deactivate Repairer
Clerk -> System : 提交安全检查结果(工单号、结论)
activate System
alt 检查合格
  System -> System : 关闭工单并恢复装备可租状态()
else 检查不合格
  System -> System : 保持维修状态并重新生成维修待办()
end
System -> System : 记录状态变化与审计轨迹()
System --> Clerk : 返回工单和装备最终状态
deactivate System

@enduml
